<title>CROATIA: Croatia's Kras to raise DM60 mln syndicated loan.</title>
<headline>Croatia's Kras to raise DM60 mln syndicated loan.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia's leading confectioner Kras has mandated Germany's Bayerische Vereinsbank to arrange the syndication of a 60 million German mark loan, company officials said on Monday.</p>
<p>Kras hopes the overall charges will be less than five percent a year for six years, including a one-year grace period, board president Boris Marcac told a news conference.</p>
</text>
